## 11. 建议的演示数据模型

可按现有项目技术栈调整字段名，但实体关系保持清晰：

```text
Store
  store_id, name, brand, city, neighborhood, coordinates, status
  footprint_type, gross_area_m2, net_area_m2, sales_area_m2
  service_area, power_mode, demo_flag

StoreLayout
  layout_id, store_id, version, length_m, width_m, area_m2
  objects[]: object_id, type, x, y, width, depth, rotation, zone

Fixture
  fixture_id, store_id, type, position, dimensions, status, power_w

SKU
  sku_id, name, brand, category, package_size, price, cost
  stock_on_hand, reserved_stock, avg_daily_sales, expiry_batches[]
